--[[
    GPT World Model - read-only X-Ray adapter
    Target: S.T.A.L.K.E.R.: Call of Pripyat 1.6.02 / original X-Ray

    This module provides a static world catalog, read-only X-Ray snapshots,
    and explicit source-aware knowledge claims for the unique companion.
    It does not scan the world, call an LLM, or change NPC behavior.
]]

gpt_world = gpt_world or {}

